	)
	(text "ENVELOPE UI (Bread Modular ENV): MODE (PC0) + LEDs HR/AR/ASR (PC1, PA4, PA5);\nREC (PC2) + LED (PC3) records the knob positions (8bit crash style). Internal pull-ups."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "789d8af8-6e19-51e2-a52b-10bc6e88fd56")
	)
	(text "MIDI IN (TS): 8bit / LOW / ACID NPN front end, pull-ups on +5V; J5 MIDI OUT = passive thru of J1. JP1 shipped OPEN: 1-2 = protected (PORT_INVEN on PB3), 2-3 = direct.\nGATE IN (J6): NPN gate buffer -> PB2 (inverted); TN jack detect -> PB1: patched = high = MIDI notes bypassed, the gate drives the envelope."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "90388a31-088a-560c-b611-87c89fd9c284")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR ENV - S4 schematic: the ACID envelope (Bread Modular ENV on one ATtiny1616) as its own 6HP MIDI + GATE module, 5 V internal signals. Circuit intent: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e3dee7c0-4744-5acf-a2d2-eec4569ad484")
	)
